IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `dg-core`
IMPORT `dg6-s251a-agreement`
IMPORT `dg6-s251h-tender-offer`

-- Tests of dg6-s251h-tender-offer.l4 (8 Del. C. § 251(h)).
-- Every expected value was written by hand from the text (de-code-t8-ch1-2026-10-01.txt, lines 1091-1108) before the file
-- was run. A failing assertion is a finding: no expected value was edited to match the code.

§ `Tests of s 251(h)`

§§ `s 251(h)(6) definitions`

-- (h)(6)e. every kind of entity in the core is a person.
#ASSERT `s 251(h)(6)e. the kind of entity is a person` `a natural person`
#ASSERT `s 251(h)(6)e. the kind of entity is a person` (`a corporation` `a stock corporation`)
#ASSERT `s 251(h)(6)e. the kind of entity is a person` `a limited liability company`
#ASSERT `s 251(h)(6)e. the kind of entity is a person` `a joint-stock association`
#ASSERT `s 251(h)(6)e. the kind of entity is a person` `a statutory trust`
#ASSERT `s 251(h)(6)e. the kind of entity is a person` `any other unincorporated business or association`

-- (h)(6)a. an affiliate owns all the offeror's stock (i), or is a wholly-owned subsidiary of the offeror or of such an owner (ii).
#ASSERT `s 251(h)(6)a. the person is an affiliate of the corporation making the offer` `a natural person` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 251(h)(6)a. the person is an affiliate of the corporation making the offer` (`a corporation` `a stock corporation`) FALSE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 251(h)(6)a. the person is an affiliate of the corporation making the offer` (`a corporation` `a stock corporation`) FALSE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 251(h)(6)a. the person is an affiliate of the corporation making the offer` (`a corporation` `a stock corporation`) FALSE FALSE FALSE)

-- (h)(6)b. and (h)(6)c.
#ASSERT `s 251(h)(6)b. the corporation consummates the offer` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 251(h)(6)b. the corporation consummates the offer` FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 251(h)(6)c. the agent is a depository` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 251(h)(6)c. the agent is a depository` FALSE)

-- (h)(6)g. rollover stock, and when it ceases to be rollover stock for paragraph (h)(3).
#ASSERT `s 251(h)(6)g. the shares are rollover stock` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 251(h)(6)g. the shares are rollover stock` FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 251(h)(6)g. the shares are rollover stock for the purposes of paragraph (h)(3)` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 251(h)(6)g. the shares are rollover stock for the purposes of paragraph (h)(3)` TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 251(h)(6)g. the shares are rollover stock for the purposes of paragraph (h)(3)` FALSE FALSE)

-- (h)(6)d. excluded stock: stock owned at the commencement of the offer by the four named holders, or rollover stock.
#ASSERT `s 251(h)(6)d. the stock is excluded stock` `owned by the constituent corporation at the commencement of the offer` FALSE
#ASSERT `s 251(h)(6)d. the stock is excluded stock` `owned by the corporation making the offer at the commencement of the offer` FALSE
#ASSERT `s 251(h)(6)d. the stock is excluded stock` `owned by a person that owns, directly or indirectly, all of the outstanding stock of the corporation making the offer, at the commencement of the offer` FALSE
#ASSERT `s 251(h)(6)d. the stock is excluded stock` `owned by a direct or indirect wholly-owned subsidiary of any of the foregoing at the commencement of the offer` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 251(h)(6)d. the stock is excluded stock` `owned by some other holder at the commencement of the offer` FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 251(h)(6)d. the stock is excluded stock` `owned by some other holder at the commencement of the offer` TRUE

-- (h)(6)f. "received": the step for the kind of holding, unless the certificate was canceled or the uncertificated shares were
-- reduced or eliminated by a sale before consummation of the offer.
#ASSERT `s 251(h)(6)f. the shares are received` `certificated shares` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 251(h)(6)f. the shares are received` `certificated shares` TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 251(h)(6)f. the shares are received` `certificated shares` FALSE FALSE FALSE)
-- A sale does not unreceive a certificated share; a cancelled certificate does not unreceive an uncertificated one.
#ASSERT `s 251(h)(6)f. the shares are received` `certificated shares` TRUE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT `s 251(h)(6)f. the shares are received` `uncertificated shares held of record by a clearing corporation as nominee` TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 251(h)(6)f. the shares are received` `uncertificated shares held of record by a clearing corporation as nominee` TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 251(h)(6)f. the shares are received` `uncertificated shares held of record by a clearing corporation as nominee` FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 251(h)(6)f. the shares are received` `uncertificated shares held of record by a person other than a clearing corporation as nominee` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 251(h)(6)f. the shares are received` `uncertificated shares held of record by a person other than a clearing corporation as nominee` TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 251(h)(6)f. the shares are received` `uncertificated shares held of record by a person other than a clearing corporation as nominee` FALSE FALSE FALSE)

§§ `s 251(h)(3) the shares held after the offer`

-- A tally: votes outstanding, votes received by the depository, votes otherwise owned, votes of rollover stock, requirement.
GIVEN outstanding IS A NUMBER
      received IS A NUMBER
      owned IS A NUMBER
      rollover IS A NUMBER
      requirement IS A `Vote requirement`
GIVETH A `s 251(h)(3) Tally of stock`
`test tally` outstanding received owned rollover requirement MEANS
    `s 251(h)(3) Tally of stock` OF outstanding, received, owned, rollover, requirement

`a majority of the outstanding stock` MEANS `a majority of` `the outstanding stock entitled to vote`
`two thirds of the outstanding stock` MEANS `at least` ((200 DIVIDED BY 3)%) `of` `the outstanding stock entitled to vote`

-- A majority of 1,000 votes is more than 500: 400 + 100 + 0 = 500 is not enough, 501 is.
#ASSERT `s 251(h)(3) the stock held after the offer reaches the vote that would have been required for one tally` (`test tally` 1000 400 100 0 `a majority of the outstanding stock`) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 251(h)(3) the stock held after the offer reaches the vote that would have been required for one tally` (`test tally` 1000 401 100 0 `a majority of the outstanding stock`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- All three kinds of holding count: 300 received + 100 owned + 101 rollover = 501.
#ASSERT `s 251(h)(3) the stock held after the offer reaches the vote that would have been required for one tally` (`test tally` 1000 300 100 101 `a majority of the outstanding stock`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- A certificate that requires 66 2/3%: of 900 votes that is exactly 600, which "equals at least" the percentage.
#ASSERT `s 251(h)(3) the stock held after the offer reaches the vote that would have been required for one tally` (`test tally` 900 500 100 0 `two thirds of the outstanding stock`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 251(h)(3) the stock held after the offer reaches the vote that would have been required for one tally` (`test tally` 900 499 100 0 `two thirds of the outstanding stock`) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Counts that cannot be a vote are not covered.
#ASSERT `s 251(h)(3) the stock held after the offer reaches the vote that would have been required for one tally` (`test tally` 1000 800 300 0 `a majority of the outstanding stock`) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 251(h)(3) the stock held after the offer reaches the vote that would have been required for one tally` (`test tally` 0 0 0 0 `a majority of the outstanding stock`) EQUALS NOTHING

-- "of such constituent corporation, and of each class or series thereof": every tally must be met.
`all the stock, met` MEANS `test tally` 1000 600 0 0 `a majority of the outstanding stock`
`one class, met` MEANS `test tally` 200 150 0 0 `a majority of the outstanding stock`
`one class, not met` MEANS `test tally` 200 99 0 0 `a majority of the outstanding stock`
`one class, not a vote` MEANS `test tally` 200 250 0 0 `a majority of the outstanding stock`
#ASSERT `s 251(h)(3) the stock held after the offer reaches the vote that would have been required for the stock and for each class or series` (LIST `all the stock, met`, `one class, met`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 251(h)(3) the stock held after the offer reaches the vote that would have been required for the stock and for each class or series` (LIST `all the stock, met`, `one class, not met`) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 251(h)(3) the stock held after the offer reaches the vote that would have been required for the stock and for each class or series` (LIST `all the stock, met`, `one class, not a vote`) EQUALS NOTHING
-- No tally at all is not covered, and is not "met".
#ASSERT `s 251(h)(3) the stock held after the offer reaches the vote that would have been required for the stock and for each class or series` EMPTY EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `s 251(h) the conditions, the certification and the filing`

-- "listed on a national securities exchange or held of record by more than 2,000 holders": 2,000 is not more than 2,000.
#ASSERT `s 251(h) the constituent corporation has stock listed or held of record by more than 2,000 holders` TRUE 5
#ASSERT `s 251(h) the constituent corporation has stock listed or held of record by more than 2,000 holders` FALSE 2001
#ASSERT NOT (`s 251(h) the constituent corporation has stock listed or held of record by more than 2,000 holders` FALSE 2000)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 251(h) the constituent corporation has stock listed or held of record by more than 2,000 holders` FALSE 1999)

-- Terms: (1)a. and (1)b. in the agreement, (2) offer consummated, (4) offeror merges in, (5) same consideration for the rest.
GIVEN t1a IS A BOOLEAN
      t1b IS A BOOLEAN
      t2 IS A BOOLEAN
      t4 IS A BOOLEAN
      t5 IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 251(h) Terms of the merger and the offer`
`test h terms` t1a t1b t2 t4 t5 MEANS
    `s 251(h) Terms of the merger and the offer` OF t1a, t1b, t2, t4, t5

`good h terms` MEANS `test h terms` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT `s 251(h) no vote of the stockholders of the constituent corporation is necessary` TRUE FALSE `good h terms` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Condition (3) not covered, and nothing else defeats the exemption: not covered.
#ASSERT `s 251(h) no vote of the stockholders of the constituent corporation is necessary` TRUE FALSE `good h terms` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 251(h) no vote of the stockholders of the constituent corporation is necessary` TRUE FALSE `good h terms` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Anything else that fails defeats it, even if (3) is not covered.
#ASSERT `s 251(h) no vote of the stockholders of the constituent corporation is necessary` FALSE FALSE `good h terms` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 251(h) no vote of the stockholders of the constituent corporation is necessary` TRUE TRUE `good h terms` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 251(h) no vote of the stockholders of the constituent corporation is necessary` TRUE FALSE (`test h terms` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 251(h) no vote of the stockholders of the constituent corporation is necessary` TRUE FALSE (`test h terms` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 251(h) no vote of the stockholders of the constituent corporation is necessary` TRUE FALSE (`test h terms` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 251(h) no vote of the stockholders of the constituent corporation is necessary` TRUE FALSE (`test h terms` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 251(h) no vote of the stockholders of the constituent corporation is necessary` TRUE FALSE (`test h terms` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- Permissions in (h)(2).
#ASSERT `s 251(h)(2) the offer may be conditioned on the tender of a minimum number or percentage of shares` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 251(h)(2) the corporation may consummate separate offers for separate classes or series` TRUE

-- Certification, filing and representation.
#ASSERT `s 251(h) the secretary or assistant secretary of the surviving corporation must certify that the agreement was adopted under s 251(h) and that its conditions other than (h)(4) are satisfied` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 251(h) the secretary or assistant secretary of the surviving corporation must certify that the agreement was adopted under s 251(h) and that its conditions other than (h)(4) are satisfied` TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 251(h) the secretary or assistant secretary of the surviving corporation must certify that the agreement was adopted under s 251(h) and that its conditions other than (h)(4) are satisfied` FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 251(h) the agreement so adopted and certified is then to be filed` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 251(h) the agreement so adopted and certified is then to be filed` FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 251(h) the person who executes the agreement represents that the facts stated in the certificate remain true` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 251(h) the person who executes the agreement represents that the facts stated in the certificate remain true` FALSE)
